<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-23T07:47:20.153Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang. Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. The Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for military training and announced six trust measures to test Cambodia’s sincerity, while ASEAN and the UN are hosting talks on border heritage sites and peace forums. The WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative, and China issued a travel warning over kidnapping and job scams targeting Thailand. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOVk5BRlJiM09FUFBBWUZZX09DMHladmJXeDFOLTR3RDNvRzZQWUp3OUIyMmFyM29Cc0FIbkpMOGRXa210YzdrVDgyRlk1eFZoaUk4d3NsQkhBOUNlOERyZWoxLURvcDVpMjJlV3lSSWJsck13dDBXc2hjV3hWVURCdk1ZMGJFNTZNbU1pc3JTWDFGXzJrZU1FTWhaWFJUTHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPbmlSaWxxWVEzWk03Tk5tWUFqRFR2dkZBaHU2QXRzOXlIN2ZqOGd2NlNkd2haWDNhNGxRdGdJOWhkMVpmaG8zN2FMcmpOSzM5Vm1WQnRZVmpMZ2doTzZUWGxCa2tBNXZzc0V2bnl4a1MzX2U0dHRBaWNsald0ekZSdzFQWWhabnJNdllKMGpPNE95ZlRzSUhSVWYtUW9WblFaUVJwbVozVmRFY0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNeUJIMDhVQmU4TkdNeTUzS3A0QnNacVgtMkJyMV91cFVySEx1NUxIUWVaNy1XOWdSY2FkbW5yVEdTT0d0VVZIZmR0SUxGZFBqekRfZUZpdzJLV3Bnek9ZNzJreTJfaVlxT3REZUZVZmg4ckpLdUJXdGhHTWxuNVN4TExDVWNTLWkyLWZIZGJ3dVR1ZEJhS3FCSTl3ekVnMzZjdjN3LUs4UkdnQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Business Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUx